{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836522",
      "title": "Managing State to Switch Between Components",
      "sourceHash": "36057bf00028082f147dfb66dfa45e630f195aa147cf522ebdbd5f5cb80674d9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 1.86,
          "en": "So we wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.86,
          "end": 3.75,
          "en": "that we either show this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.75,
          "end": 6.48,
          "en": "or this NewProject component depending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.48,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "on whether this add project button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 11.403,
          "en": "or this button here was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "And for that, we'll, of course, need state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "because state then allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "to render content conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 22.38,
          "en": "And we'll need to manage this state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "in the App component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 26.61,
          "en": "because that's where we make this decision",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.61,
          "end": 28.653,
          "en": "about which component to display.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.73,
          "end": 33.57,
          "en": "Hence, in here, we should use the useState hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.57,
          "end": 36.573,
          "en": "which, of course, must be imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.16,
          "end": 40.143,
          "en": "So this import must be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "And then here we have this state that controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.123,
          "en": "which component is displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.47,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "Now, there are definitely many valid ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 57.68,
          "en": "of managing the state here, but I'll go for an approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 60.87,
          "en": "where I'll manage an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 65.507,
          "en": "as a state which has a selectedProject property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 69.903,
          "en": "which I'll initially set to undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 73.65,
          "en": "not to null, but to undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.65,
          "end": 76.533,
          "en": "And I'll soon show you why I'm doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.85,
          "en": "And I'll add a projects array here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.85,
          "end": 83.43,
          "en": "where we'll later add the projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.43,
          "end": 85.35300000000001,
          "en": "that are created by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.97,
          "end": 89.527,
          "en": "Now, I'll name that state projectsState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 92.75999999999999,
          "en": "because that sounds like a good name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.75999999999999,
          "end": 97.65299999999999,
          "en": "for this object and setProjectsState to update it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.94,
          "end": 103.94,
          "en": "Now, my idea behind adding this selectedProject property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 107.16,
          "en": "and setting it to undefined initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "is that this selectedProject property will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "to either store the ID of the project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "that was selected when we later have multiple projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 121,
          "en": "that can be selected here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 127.42,
          "en": "or null if we want to add a new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "or undefined if we're not adding a new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 134.703,
          "en": "and we also did not select any project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 138.66,
          "en": "Now that's, of course, just one way of managing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.66,
          "end": 140.57999999999998,
          "en": "You could also add another state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.57999999999998,
          "end": 142.953,
          "en": "which you maybe name currentAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.42000000000002,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "and that could be something like adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 151.7,
          "en": "or selectedProject or nothing selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "which you could then also use to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 156.423,
          "en": "what's being displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "Here I just wanna work with as little state as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 163.69,
          "en": "which is why I'm reusing this one property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "and I'll rename it to selectedProjectId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "to be a bit clearer about its purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "So initially, it's undefined, which simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "that we're neither adding a new project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 178.623,
          "en": "nor have a project selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.57999999999998,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "But that should change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 183.453,
          "en": "if we click this add project button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.71,
          "end": 187.293,
          "en": "Then it should change to null instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.52,
          "end": 190.26,
          "en": "So I'll add a new function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.26,
          "end": 192.12,
          "en": "in the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 197.12,
          "en": "handleStartAddProject could be a fitting name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.43,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "because this should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "once we start adding a project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 203.14,
          "en": "by clicking one of these two buttons here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 208.473,
          "en": "and in there, I wanna update my project's state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "And of course, I wanna update it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 213.75,
          "en": "such that we don't lose the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.75,
          "end": 214.95,
          "en": "because that old state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "for example, includes all our projects, which later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 221.373,
          "en": "of course, will not be an empty array anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 225.15,
          "en": "And therefore, we need that function form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 227.31,
          "en": "where we get the previous state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.31,
          "end": 231.933,
          "en": "and return the updated state, the updated state object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 237.55700000000002,
          "en": "And in here, I'll set my selectedProjectId to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.29,
          "end": 244.23,
          "en": "because as I explained before, that should act",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.23,
          "end": 249.15,
          "en": "as a signal for us that we're now adding a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 249.15,
          "end": 251.31,
          "en": "Undefined means that we're doing nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.31,
          "end": 254.13,
          "en": "Null means that we're adding a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 257.31,
          "en": "And that's, of course, just my definition in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.31,
          "end": 260.613,
          "en": "You can definitely also go for a different solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.69,
          "end": 264.42,
          "en": "I'll also make sure that we don't lose the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 264.42,
          "end": 266.04,
          "en": "by spreading the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 266.04,
          "end": 268.473,
          "en": "into this newly returned state object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 269.82,
          "end": 272.14,
          "en": "Now we need to connect handleStartAddProject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 273.366,
          "end": 276,
          "en": "to this NoProjectSelected component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276,
          "end": 279.033,
          "en": "so that in there, we can connect it to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 280.8,
          "end": 282.33,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll add a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.33,
          "end": 287.133,
          "en": "which I'll name onStartAddProject, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.51,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "where I'll point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 293.883,
          "en": "at this handleStartAddProject function we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.13,
          "end": 300.69,
          "en": "And I'll do the same on my sidebar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.69,
          "end": 302.85,
          "en": "because there we have this other button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.85,
          "end": 306.423,
          "en": "that should start this add project process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.13,
          "end": 312.66,
          "en": "Now we, of course, must go to those components and accept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 312.66,
          "end": 317.073,
          "en": "and destructure this onStartAddProject prop there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 317.97,
          "end": 321.24,
          "en": "So for example, in the ProjectSidebar component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 321.24,
          "end": 324.69,
          "en": "I'm destructuring it here and we can now connect it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 324.69,
          "end": 329.69,
          "en": "to this button where we add the onClick prop and then point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.88,
          "end": 334.08,
          "en": "at the onStartAddProject prop so that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.08,
          "end": 338.64,
          "en": "this handleStartAddProject function pointer is forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 338.64,
          "end": 340.653,
          "en": "to the onClick prop in this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.3,
          "end": 345.75,
          "en": "And keep in mind that in this button, the onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.75,
          "end": 348.72,
          "en": "is simply collected with all the other props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.72,
          "end": 353.31,
          "en": "and is spread onto the native built-in button element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.31,
          "end": 356.673,
          "en": "so that this entire connection can be established.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 358.95,
          "end": 359.85,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 359.85,
          "end": 362.4,
          "en": "we should be able to start adding a new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 362.4,
          "end": 364.74,
          "en": "from inside the sidebar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.74,
          "end": 369.74,
          "en": "in the NoProjectSelected component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 370.3,
          "end": 375.3,
          "en": "We of course also need to accept this OnStartAddProject prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 375.66,
          "end": 378.52,
          "en": "and there connect it to this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 380.16,
          "end": 383.283,
          "en": "by forwarding it to the onClick prop there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 386.55,
          "end": 389.25,
          "en": "Now both components are connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 389.25,
          "end": 393.09000000000003,
          "en": "and we therefore now can use the project's state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 393.09000000000003,
          "end": 398.09000000000003,
          "en": "to either render this component or the NewProject component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 400.38,
          "end": 402.65999999999997,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a new variable here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 402.65999999999997,
          "end": 405.54,
          "en": "content, where I'll check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 405.54,
          "end": 410.407,
          "en": "if projectsState.selectedProjectId is equal to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 416.22,
          "en": "which as explained before, should mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 416.22,
          "end": 418.293,
          "en": "that we wanna add a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 419.28,
          "end": 422.13,
          "en": "So therefore, in that case, I'll set content equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 422.13,
          "end": 425.043,
          "en": "to this NewProject component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 426.81,
          "end": 430.84,
          "en": "Else if projectsState.selectedProjectId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 435.03,
          "end": 438.843,
          "en": "is equal to undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 440.31,
          "end": 442.38,
          "en": "I wanna set content equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 442.38,
          "end": 445.923,
          "en": "to my NoProjectSelected component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 447.3,
          "end": 449.73,
          "en": "So in the end, to this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 449.73,
          "end": 454.32,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll grab and use that and later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 454.32,
          "end": 455.31,
          "en": "we'll also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 455.31,
          "end": 459.24,
          "en": "that content could also hold a selectedProject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 459.24,
          "end": 461.88,
          "en": "But for the moment, it's either of these two components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 461.88,
          "end": 464.46,
          "en": "and therefore, now we can simply output content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 464.46,
          "end": 466.923,
          "en": "down there next to the sidebar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 468.75,
          "end": 472.92,
          "en": "And with that, by using state here like we're doing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 472.92,
          "end": 475.92,
          "en": "if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 475.92,
          "end": 478.77,
          "en": "initially, we should see this fallback screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 478.77,
          "end": 480.3,
          "en": "but if I click this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
